black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            フィンランド式アウトドアサウナ「ノーラ名栗（Nolla naguri）」とは？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 名栗の山あいに広がる複合施設で、貸切テントサウナでのロウリュ体験や冷たい清流でのクールダウン、北欧風BBQが満喫できます。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            埼玉の奥座敷「名栗温泉（なぐりおんせん）」の魅力は？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 入間川の源流・名栗川沿いに湧く冷鉱泉で、豊かな自然と静寂に包まれながら肌触りの良い湯と川魚・山菜料理に癒されます。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-12 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-stone-50 via-amber-50/40 to-orange-50/30 border border-amber-200/80 shadow-md\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 border-b border-amber-200 pb-3\">\n    <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">関連記事ナビ</span>\n    <h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">🗺️ あわせて読みたい！埼玉県＆周辺エリアの厳選宿ガイド</h3>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-4\">\n    <!-- 同一都道府県エリア特集 -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-amber-900 flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-amber-100 pb-2\">\n        <span>📍</span> 埼玉県のエリア別・後悔回避宿特集\n      </h4>\n      <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/autumn-kanto-chichibu-soba-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】関東 秩父新そば・和栗・秋の山菜会席と自家源泉の温泉宿特集！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">秩父・長瀞</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/chichibu-nagatoro-mitsumine-hotels-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】秩父・長瀞おすすめ高級宿10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">秩父市・秩父郡長瀞町・小鹿野町・皆野町（西武秩父駅前・三峯神社・長瀞岩畳・美の山・宝登山）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/chichibu-onsen-ryokan-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】秩父温泉おすすめ宿・日帰り温泉・和の寛ぎ露天風呂ガイド！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">秩父・長瀞</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/kawagoe-koedo-tokinokane-hotels-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】小江戸川越おすすめ宿10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">川越市（本川越駅・川越駅・蔵造りの町並み一番街・時の鐘・菓子屋横丁・喜多院）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 近隣・隣接都道府県の人気特集 -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-orange-900 flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-orange-100 pb-2\">\n        <span>🚗</span> 周遊・隣接エリアのおすすめ特集\n      </h4>\n      <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/ibaraki-h